Get ready to tap, fly, and dodge your way through WiseFlappy! Guide your character through a path of pipes and see how long you can keep flying. Tap the screen to flap upward, watch your timing, and try not to crash. Every pipe you pass adds a point to your score.

Each round starts with a countdown, so get ready before the flying begins. The game is easy to learn, but getting a high score takes quick reactions and careful timing. One little tap can help you rise; one missed gap can end the run.

Make the game your own in Settings. Choose a character image, pick a custom background, and select your crash sound and flying song. You can also turn the sound on or off whenever you like.

Start a new game, pause for a break, restart after a crash, or return to the menu. Challenge yourself to beat your best score and share WiseFlappy with friends to see who can fly the farthest.

